# Coinme Risk SDK — Cloudsmith distribution token (shared iOS + Android)
#
# The same token is used for both platforms:
#   - iOS: embedded in a CocoaPods git spec URL at https://packages.coinme.com
#          (which proxies Cloudsmith under the hood).
#   - Android: embedded in the Cloudsmith Maven URL
#          https://dl.cloudsmith.io/<TOKEN>/coinme/coinme-sdk-mobile/maven/
#
# How to use:
#   1. Copy this file to `coinme.properties` in the same directory
#      (payAiro-app/).
#   2. Replace the placeholder below with the "Mobile SDK distribution key"
#      provided by the Coinme business development team.
#   3. iOS: run `bundle exec pod install` from `ios/`.
#      Android: run a normal Gradle build — `android/build.gradle` reads this
#      file first, then falls back to `android/local.properties`, then to the
#      `COINME_TOKEN` environment variable.
#
# IMPORTANT:
#   - `coinme.properties` is git-ignored and must NEVER be committed.
#   - If you cannot use a properties file (e.g. on CI), export the token as an
#     environment variable instead:  export COINME_TOKEN=<token>
#   - The token is consumed only at dependency-resolution time; it never lands
#     inside the built APK / IPA / AAB.
COINME_TOKEN=YOUR_COINME_DISTRIBUTION_TOKEN_HERE
